    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nyanzou never cleans up after playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Kumakichi tells him to, Nyanzou heads outside to play without cleaning anything up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with rage, Kumakichi decides in his heart to destroy everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy, destroy, and destroy them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kumakichi\u2019s destruction action game is here and now available  in full DX glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Kumakichi's Birth \u2606 Destruction God to even more in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way more stages in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-new ultimate moves in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full voice acting and more content in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options to customize characters in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come experience DX destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The PC version does not have online battle functionality. Instead, you can play single player on maps that are used in online battles on other platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Settings change keys]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc: End game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F11: Switch to full screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F5 (title screen): Switch language</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nyanzou never cleans up after playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Kumakichi tells him to, Nyanzou heads outside to play without cleaning anything up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with rage, Kumakichi decides in his heart to destroy everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy, destroy, and destroy them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kumakichi\u2019s destruction action game is here and now available  in full DX glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Kumakichi's Birth \u2606 Destruction God to even more in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way more stages in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-new ultimate moves in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full voice acting and more content in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options to customize characters in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come experience DX destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The PC version does not have online battle functionality. Instead, you can play single player on maps that are used in online battles on other platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Settings change keys]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc: End game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F11: Switch to full screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F5 (title screen): Switch language</p>",
